# Optional local-only non-secret toggles.
#
# Namleh fork rule: do not put API keys, service tokens, or tunnel credentials in
# .env files. Secrets belong in the Namleh-hosted Vault or the approved agent
# auth store for the tool that needs them.
#
# Paid evals require ANTHROPIC_API_KEY at runtime, but it must be injected from
# the approved secret source for that environment.
